          concept: "## The agent loop\n\nGive the model a set of tools (functions) it can call, describe them, and let it decide: respond directly, or call a tool and use the result to decide the next step - looping until it has a final answer.\n\n## Where agents actually fail\n\nAgents can loop forever, call the wrong tool, or hallucinate a tool result. Production agents need hard step limits, tool-call validation, and a fallback path when the agent gets stuck.",
